intersection_of: part_of UBERON:0005725 ! olfactory system
relationship: connects UBERON:0001707 ! nasal cavity
relationship: homologous_in NCBITaxon:7742 ! Vertebrata
relationship: in_lateral_side_of UBERON:0000033 {gci_relation="part_of", gci_filler="NCBITaxon:7776"} ! head
