property_value: external_definition "The mantle of gray matter forming the cerebral cortex. http://www.thefreedictionary.com/pallium[TAO]" xsd:string
property_value: homology_notes "In the anatomy of animals, an avian pallium is the dorsal telencephalon of a bird's brain. Pallium of avian species tend to be relatively large, comprising ~75% of the telencephalic volume." xsd:string {source="Avian:pallium", taxon="NCBITaxon:8782"}
