[Term]
id: UBERON:0000483
name: epithelium
namespace: uberon
def: "Portion of tissue, that consists of one or more layers of epithelial cells connected to each other by cell junctions and which is underlain by a basal lamina. Examples: simple squamous epithelium, glandular cuboidal epithelium, transitional epithelium, myoepithelium[CARO]." [CARO:MAH, Wikipedia:Epithelium]
