synonym: "presumptive central nervous system" RELATED []
synonym: "tubus neuralis" RELATED LATIN [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neural_tube]
synonym: "tubus neuralis" RELATED LATIN [Wikipedia:Neural_tube]
