[Term]
id: UBERON:0001198
name: superior suprarenal artery
namespace: uberon
def: "Each (left and right) superior suprarenal artery is a branch of the inferior phrenic artery on that side of the body. The left and right phrenic arteries supply the diaphragm, and come off the aorta. [WP,unvetted]." [Wikipedia:Superior_suprarenal_artery]
