[Term]
id: UBERON:0001212
name: duodenal gland
namespace: uberon
def: "A compound tubular submucosal gland found in that portion of the duodenum which is above the hepatopancreatic sphincter (Sphincter of Oddi). The main function of these glands is to produce a mucus-rich alkaline secretion (containing bicarbonate)[WP]." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brunner's_glands]
