[Term]
id: UBERON:0001319
name: vaginal vein
namespace: uberon
def: "One the veins that drains the vaginal venous plexus, into the hypogastric veins. [WP,modified]." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vaginal_venous_plexus]
