[Term]
id: UBERON:0001733
name: soft palate
namespace: uberon
def: "soft tissue constituting the back of the roof of the mouth. The soft palate is distinguished from the hard palate at the front of the mouth in that it does not contain bone[WP]. The soft palate is the posterior portion of the palate extending from the posterior edge of the hard palate[GO]." [GO:0060023, Wikipedia:Soft_palate]
def: "soft tissue constituting the back of the roof of the mouth. The soft palate is distinguished from the hard palate at the front of the mouth in that it does not contain bone[WP]. The soft palate is the posterior portion of the palate extending from the posterior edge of the hard palate[GO]." [GO:0060023, http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soft_palate]
