property_value: function_notes "aids the process of digestion of lipids in the small intestine" xsd:string
property_value: function_notes "bile salts function to emulsify dietary fats and facilitate their intestinal absorption" xsd:string
property_value: function_notes "elimination of cholesterol" xsd:string
property_value: function_notes "major excretory route for potentially harmful exogenous lipophilic substances" xsd:string
property_value: function_notes "many hormones and pheromones are excreted in bile, and contribute to growth and development of the intestine in some species and provide attractants for the weaning of non-human vertebrates" xsd:string
property_value: function_notes "protects the organism from enteric infections by excreting immune globulin A (IgA), inflammatory cytokines, and stimulating the innate immune system in the intestine" xsd:string
