synonym: "truncus pulmonalis" RELATED LATIN [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pulmonary_artery]
synonym: "truncus pulmonalis, arteria pulmonalis" RELATED LATIN [Wikipedia:Pulmonary_artery]
