synonym: "epencephalon-1" EXACT [FMA:67944]
synonym: "infratentorial region" BROAD [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tentorium_cerebelli]
synonym: "parencephalon" RELATED LATIN [NeuroNames:643]
