[Term]
id: UBERON:0002260
name: ventral root of spinal cord
namespace: uberon
def: "The efferent motor root of a spinal nerve. At its distal end, the ventral root joins with the dorsal root to form a mixed spinal nerve." [Wikipedia:Anterior_root_of_spinal_nerve]
def: "The ventral roots contain efferent motor axons. Similar to the dorsal roots, the ventral roots continue out from the spinal column, and meet and mix with their corresponding dorsal nerve root at a point after the ganglion." [NIFSTD:nlx_anat_20090209]
