namespace: uberon
def: "The pars tuberalis is part of the anterior lobe of the pituitary gland, and wraps the pituitary stalk in a highly vascularized sheath. [WP,unvetted]." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pars_tuberalis]
def: "The pars tuberalis is part of the anterior lobe of the pituitary gland, and wraps the pituitary stalk in a highly vascularized sheath. [WP,unvetted]." [Wikipedia:Pars_tuberalis]
