synonym: "gyrus temporalis superior" RELATED LATIN [Wikipedia:Superior_temporal_gyrus]
synonym: "gyrus temporalis superior" RELATED LATIN [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superior_temporal_gyrus]
