[Term]
id: UBERON:0002833
name: medial nucleus of trapezoid body
namespace: uberon
def: "Nucleus in the pontine tegmentum of most mammals that receives projections from the ventral cochlear nucleus via the large specialized synapse, the Calyx of Held. It is not clear whether a well defined nucleus is present in humans, although humans may possess scattered cells with similar input." [NIFSTD:birnlex_2595]
synonym: "MNTB" EXACT ABBREVIATION []
