name: cingulate cortex
namespace: uberon
def: "The cingulate cortex is a part of the brain situated in the medial aspect of the cortex. It is extended from the corpus callosum below to the cingulate sulcus above, at least anteriorly. [WP,unvetted]." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cingulate_cortex]
