[Term]
id: UBERON:0003107
name: Meckel's cartilage
namespace: uberon
def: "Meckel's cartilage is the bilaterally paired, rod-like, cartilaginous ventral component of the lower jar, or ventral mandibular arch. It is typically resorbed in adults." [PMID:3693112, Wikipedia:Meckel's_cartilage]
def: "Meckel's cartilage is the bilaterally paired, rod-like, cartilaginous ventral component of the lower jar, or ventral mandibular arch. It is typically resorbed in adults." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meckel's_cartilage, http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/3693112]
