xref: XAO:0000118
is_a: UBERON:0000117 ! respiratory tube
relationship: contributes_to_morphology_of UBERON:0001004 ! respiratory system
relationship: develops_from UBERON:0008947 ! respiratory primordium
relationship: foaf-depicted_by http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9f/Illu_conducting_passages.svg
relationship: foaf-depicted_by http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c3/Illu_conducting_passages.jpg
relationship: homologous_in NCBITaxon:7742 ! Vertebrata
