[Term]
id: UBERON:0003142
name: prepupa
namespace: uberon
def: "An organism at the prepupal stage. The prepupal stage is a life stage interposed between the larval and the pupal stages in insects that undergo a complete metamorphosis. The start of the pre-pupal stage is marked by pupariation, and the end is marked by pupation" [GO:0035210]
