[Term]
id: UBERON:0004072
name: cerebellum globose nucleus
namespace: uberon
def: "the two or three small masses of gray matter that is located medial to the emboliform nucleus and lateral to the fastigial nucleus; it receives axons from the intermediate area of the cerebellar hemispheres and its afferents exit through the superior cerebellar peduncle; it is recognized in human cerebellum but is not distinguishable in all mammalian species" [MP:0009982]
