name: Harderian gland
namespace: uberon
def: "The Harderian gland is an anterior orbital gland usually associated with the nictitating membrane, and produces and secretes a variety of substances to the eye, depending upon the species[GO]." [GO:0070384, http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harderian_gland]
def: "The Harderian gland is an anterior orbital structure usually associated with the nictitating membrane, and produces and secretes a variety of substances to the eye, depending upon the species[GO]. An accessory lacrimal gland on the inner side of the orbit in reptiles and birds but usually degenerate in mammals[BTO]." [GO:0070384, Wikipedia:Harderian_gland]
