[Term]
id: UBERON:0004581
name: systemic venous system
namespace: uberon
def: "The part of the venous system that drains the general body tissues[Kardong]" [ISBN10:0073040584, Wikipedia:Systemic_venous_system]
def: "The part of the venous system that drains the general body tissues[Kardong]" [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Systemic_venous_system, ISBN10:0073040584]
