property_value: external_definition "According to the 1917 version of Gray's Anatomy, it is the combination of the lentiform nucleus (putamen and the globus pallidus) and the caudate nucleus" xsd:string {source="Dorsal:striatum"}
property_value: external_definition "According to the 1917 version of Gray's Anatomy, it is the combination of the lentiform nucleus and the caudate nucleus" xsd:string
