namespace: uberon
def: "The anterior arch forms about one-fifth of the ring: its anterior surface is convex, and presents at its center the anterior tubercle for the attachment of the Longus colli muscles." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anterior_tubercle_of_cervical_vertebra\,Wikipedia\:Anterior_tubercle_of_cervical_vertebra]
