synonym: "aortic annulus" RELATED [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fibrous_rings_of_heart]
synonym: "aortic annulus" RELATED [Wikipedia:Fibrous_rings_of_heart]
synonym: "atrioventricular ring" RELATED [BTO:0003628]
synonym: "coronary tendon" RELATED [BTO:0003628]
synonym: "fibrous ring of heart" RELATED [Wikipedia:Fibrous_rings_of_heart]
synonym: "fibrous ring of heart" RELATED [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fibrous_rings_of_heart]
