[Term]
id: UBERON:0006107
name: basolateral amygdaloid nuclear complex
namespace: uberon
def: "A set of amygdalar nuclei comprising the lateral nucleus (LA), the basal nucleus (BA), and the accessory basal nuclei (ABN). These nuclei are bordered laterally by the external capsule and medially by the central amygdalar nucleus as well as the amygdalohippocampal area. This definition refers to the rat Basolateral nuclear complex." [NIFSTD:birnlex_2679]
