namespace: uberon
def: "embryologic structure that is formed by two longitudinal eminences, one on each alar plate of the midbrain. These eminences become the superior colliculus and inferior colliculus ( Carpenter-1983 )]" [http://braininfo.rprc.washington.edu/centraldirectory.aspx?type=a&ID=453]
