def: "A pharyngeal pouch between pharyngeal arch 4 and arch 5 or 6 (a fifth arch never establishes in amniotes)." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pharyngeal_pouch_(embryology)#Fourth_pouch, http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/16313389, ISBN10:0124020607]
