id: UBERON:0007161
name: medial arcuate ligament
namespace: uberon
def: "The medial arcuate ligament (also medial lumbocostal arch) is tendinous fascia that arches over the psoas major muscle as it passes through the diaphragm." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medial_arcuate_ligament]
