[Term]
id: UBERON:0007770
name: osphradium
namespace: uberon
def: "The osphradium is the olfactory organ in certain molluscs, linked with the respiration organ. The main function of this is to test incoming water for silt and other possible food particles. It is used by all members of the Genus Conus." [BTO:0004995, Wikipedia:Osphradium]
