[Term]
id: UBERON:0008574
name: transverse arytenoid
namespace: uberon
def: "The tranverse arytenoid crosses transversely between the two cartilages. It is an unpaired muscle running from one arytenoid to another to pull the arytenoids together." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arytenoid_muscle]
def: "The tranverse arytenoid crosses transversely between the two cartilages. It is an unpaired muscle running from one arytenoid to another to pull the arytenoids together." [Wikipedia:Arytenoid_muscle]
