name: coagulating gland
namespace: uberon
def: "A lobe of the prostate in rodents that is thin and tubular and is attached to the lesser curvature of the paired seminal vesicles. Secretes substances that contribute to the formation of the copulatory plug." [http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/12645922, http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/1806140, http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/3308446, MP:0002771]
