[Term]
id: UBERON:0008891
name: external gill
namespace: uberon
def: "External gills are the gills of an animal, most typically an amphibian, that are exposed to the environment, rather than set inside the pharynx and covered by gill slits, as they are in most fishes[BTO]." [BTO:0004689, http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/External_gills]
def: "External gills are the gills of an animal, most typically an amphibian, that are exposed to the environment, rather than set inside the pharynx and covered by gill slits, as they are in most fishes[BTO]." [BTO:0004689, Wikipedia:External_gills]
xref: AAO:0010174
