namespace: uberon
def: "The prostatic veins form a well-marked prostatic plexus which lies partly in the fascial sheath of the prostate and partly between the sheath and the prostatic capsule. It communicates with the pudendal and vesical plexuses." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prostatic_venous_plexus]
