is_a: UBERON:0010000 ! multicellular anatomical structure
relationship: foaf-depicted_by http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f2/BirdRespiration.svg
relationship: only_in_taxon NCBITaxon:8782 ! Aves
relationship: part_of UBERON:0001004 ! respiratory system

