namespace: uberon
def: "A tapetum lucidum that is part of the retina, within the cytoplasm of the retinal epithelium" [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tapetum_lucidum#Classification, http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/14738502, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165]
