def: "A choroid tapetum lucidum that is made of a palisade of cells containing stacks of flat hexagonal crystals of guanine" [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tapetum_lucidum#Classification, http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/14738502, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165]
