is_a: UBERON:0010321 ! skeletal element of eye region
intersection_of: UBERON:0001474 ! bone element
intersection_of: part_of UBERON:0001712 ! upper eyelid
relationship: only_in_taxon NCBITaxon:8457 ! Sauropsida
relationship: part_of UBERON:0001712 ! upper eyelid
property_value: editor_note "PMID:16496288 says 'invests' the eyelid, is this consistent across taxa?" xsd:string
