synonym: "processus coronoideus ulnae" RELATED LATIN [Wikipedia:Coronoid_process_of_the_ulna]
synonym: "processus coronoideus ulnae" RELATED LATIN [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coronoid_process_of_the_ulna]
synonym: "ulnar coronoid process" EXACT []
