is_a: UBERON:0002530 ! gland
relationship: foaf-depicted_by http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/Civetglands.png
relationship: has_function_in GO:0035636 ! multi-organism signaling
property_value: external_definition "Exocrine glands in animals which secrete scents which either repel or attract other animals, e.g. perianal glands of skunks, anal glands of weasels, musk glands of foxes, ventral glands of wood rats, and dorsal glands of peccaries[MESH:A13.820]." xsd:string {source="MESH:A13.820"}

