namespace: uberon
def: "A putative electroreceptor organ located in the medial rostral cavity in the ethmoid portion of the chondrocranium of Coelacanths. It is surrounded by an insulating layer of adipose tissue and innervated by the superficial ophthalmic nerve." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rostral_organ]
