[Term]
id: UBERON:0011625
name: inferior horn of thyroid cartilage
namespace: uberon
def: "The inferior horn of thyroid cartilage is short and thick; it is directed downward, with a slight inclination forward and medialward, and presents, on the medial side of its tip, a small oval articular facet for articulation with the side of the cricoid cartilage." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inferior_horn_of_thyroid_cartilage]
