property_value: taxon_notes "Present in therapids and monotremes, reduced in size in marsupials and placentals. In birds, the interclavicle is fused with the clavicles to form the furcula (wishbone); the furcula forms a 'Y' shape and the interclavicle is the stem of the 'Y'." xsd:string

