[Term]
id: UBERON:0013216
name: udder
namespace: uberon
def: "A large pendulous organ consisting of two or more mammary glands enclosed in a common envelope and each provided with a single nipple." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Udder]
def: "A large pendulous organ consisting of two or more mammary glands enclosed in a common envelope and each provided with a single nipple." [Wikipedia:Udder]
