[Term]
id: UBERON:0013475
name: gustatory gland
namespace: uberon
def: "A serous salivary gland which resides adjacent to the moats surrounding the circumvallate papillae in the posterior one-third of the tongue, anterior to the terminal sulcus." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Von_Ebner's_gland]
def: "A serous salivary gland which resides adjacent to the moats surrounding the circumvallate papillae in the posterior one-third of the tongue, anterior to the terminal sulcus." [Wikipedia:Von_Ebner's_gland]
