[Term]
id: UBERON:0013546
name: Brodmann (1909) area 15
namespace: uberon
def: "Brodmann Area 15 is one of Brodmann's subdivisions of the cerebral cortex in the brain. Area 15 was defined by Brodmann in the guenon monkey, but he found no equivalent structure in humans. However, functional imaging experiments have found structures that may be homologous." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brodmann_area_15]
def: "Brodmann Area 15 is one of Brodmann's subdivisions of the cerebral cortex in the brain. Area 15 was defined by Brodmann in the guenon monkey, but he found no equivalent structure in humans. However, functional imaging experiments have found structures that may be homologous." [Wikipedia:Brodmann_area_15]
