[Term]
id: UBERON:0013730
name: mycetome
namespace: uberon
def: "A specialized organ that is linked to the gut in beetles and host to a symbiotic yeast. The yeast cells assist in the digestion of less nutritious foods, supply needed B-vitamins and sterols, and provide resistance to certain toxins." [ENVO:01000166, http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lasioderma_serricorne, PLB:plb]
xref: ENVO:01000166
