property_value: external_definition "either of a pair of organs in an insect (as a true bug) that consist of a cellular mass of mycetocytes and are located one in either fat body. a cell in various insects (as most true bugs) of a type that contains unicellular and prob. symbiotic fungi and is usu. clustered with others of its kind into paired mycetomes. ." xsd:string {source="http://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/mycetome"}

