intersection_of: part_of UBERON:0001983 ! crypt of Lieberkuhn
relationship: continuous_with UBERON:0013740 ! wall of crypt of Lieberkuhn
relationship: part_of UBERON:0001983 ! crypt of Lieberkuhn
property_value: taxon_notes "Clearly defined prolifieration zones found in mammals. Not observed in agnathostomes, larval amphibians. Described in advanced species of fish and adult amphibians. " xsd:string {source="ISBN:9780521617147"}

