xref: FMA:16988
xref: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superior_pubic_ramus
xref: http://www.snomedbrowser.com/Codes/Details/182037002
is_a: UBERON:0014444 ! pubic ramus

[Term]
id: UBERON:0014439
name: inferior pubic ramus
namespace: uberon
def: "The inferior pubic ramus is thin and flattened. It passes lateralward and downward from the medial end of the superior ramus; it becomes narrower as it descends and joins with the inferior ramus of the ischium below the obturator foramen." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inferior_pubic_ramus]
subset: pheno_slim
synonym: "inferior rami of the pubes" RELATED [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inferior_pubic_ramus]
