id: UBERON:0014526
name: anterior limb of internal capsule
namespace: uberon
def: "Portion of internal capsule lying between the lenticular nucleus and the head of the caudate nucleus." [NIFSTD:nlx_144257]
synonym: "anterior internal capsule" RELATED [ISBN10:0123813611]
