intersection_of: UBERON:0004450 ! gastric vein
intersection_of: in_left_side_of UBERON:0000468 ! multi-cellular organism
relationship: in_left_side_of UBERON:0000468 ! multi-cellular organism
property_value: implements_design_pattern "https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/wiki/Modeling-paired-structures-Design-Pattern" xsd:anyURI

