synonym: "zygomaticoorbital process of maxilla" EXACT [FMA:52895]
xref: FMA:52895
xref: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zygomatic_process_of_maxilla
xref: http://www.snomedbrowser.com/Codes/Details/272684007
