[Term]
id: UBERON:0022262
name: auditory radiation
namespace: uberon
def: "The acoustic radiations or auditory radiations are structures found in the brain, in the ventral cochlear pathway, a part of the auditory system. Lesions to the auditory radiations could be a cause of cortical deafness." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Acoustic_radiation]
