[Term]
id: UBERON:0022434
name: primary superior olive
namespace: uberon
def: "Part of the superior olivary complex of nuclei in the caudal pontine tegmentum, situated within the trapezoid body in humans.  (Brodal, Neurological Anatomy, 3rd edition, 1981, pg 617).  In many species, it comprises a medial superior olivary nucleus and a lateral superior olivary nucleus." [NIFSTD:birnlex_900]
synonym: "superior olive" BROAD INCONSISTENT [NIFSTD:birnlex_900]
xref: BAMS:SOl
xref: birnlex:900
xref: DHBA:12468
xref: HBA:9182
