xref: http://linkedlifedata.com/resource/umls/id/C0228444
is_a: UBERON:0007245 ! nuclear complex of neuraxis
is_a: UBERON:0019263 ! gray matter of hindbrain
relationship: part_of UBERON:0002128 ! superior olivary complex
property_value: external_ontology_notes "Wikipedia includes Medial nucleus of the trapezoid body. http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superior_olivary_complex#Primary_nuclei" xsd:string
property_value: terminology_notes "many sources refer to this simply as the 'superior olive' or the 'superior olivary nucleus'. However, this is confusing as superior olive is sometimes used to denote the full SOC, which includes periolvary nuclei[https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/631]" xsd:string

