relationship: part_of UBERON:0002421 ! hippocampal formation

[Term]
id: UBERON:0023934
name: olfactory bulb main glomerular layer
namespace: uberon
def: "The glomerular layer of the main olfactory bulb, lying deep to the olfactory nerve layer. It contains the glomeruli, neuropil rich spheroid structures surrounded by a distinctive shell of small neuros and glial cells (Paxinos, the Rat Nervous System, 2nd ed., Academic Press, 1995)." [NIFSTD:nlx_anat_1005011]
synonym: "olfactory bulb main glomerular layer" EXACT [NIFSTD:nlx_anat_1005011]
