[Term]
id: UBERON:0035045
name: parotid gland intralobular duct
namespace: uberon
def: "Any of the tubular canals of the parotid gland located within the parenchymal (secretory) tissue i.e. within lobules; both intercalated and striated (secretory) ducts are intralobular ducts." [MP:0013746]
is_a: UBERON:0001837 ! duct of salivary gland
is_a: UBERON:0004119 ! endoderm-derived structure
is_a: UBERON:0010314 ! structure with developmental contribution from neural crest
