[Term]
id: UBERON:2000735
name: hemal postzygapophysis
namespace: uberon/phenoscape-anatomy
def: "Paired, ventromedially directed processes on the posterior ends of the centra, ligamentously joined to the hemal postzygapophyses of the immediately posterior vertebra. The most posterior caudal vertebrae lack hemal postzygapophyses." [ZFIN:curator]
synonym: "haemal postzygapophysis" EXACT [TAO:0000735]
synonym: "hemal postygopophysis" EXACT [TAO:0000735]
