[Term]
id: UBERON:2001708
name: dermosphenotic
namespace: uberon/phenoscape-anatomy
def: "Infraorbital that is the last bone of the infraorbital series, carrying the infraorbital canal, and sometimes also the supraorbital, temporal, and/or preopercular canals. The dermosphenotic is sometimes sutured or fused completely to the skull, e.g. to the autosphenotic." [TAO:wd]
synonym: "infraorbital 5" RELATED [TAO:0001708]
synonym: "infraorbital 6" RELATED [TAO:0001708]
synonym: "infraorbital 7" RELATED [TAO:0001708]
