[Term]
id: UBERON:2100271
name: radial element
namespace: none
def: "Radial elements are the internal skeletal supports of the median and paired fins." [TAO:wd]
comment: Radial elements may be cartilaginous or bony; always present at the base of fins; typically support lepidotrichia.
synonym: "actinost" RELATED [TAO:0000271]
synonym: "radials" RELATED PLURAL [TAO:0000271]
is_a: UBERON:0010363 ! endochondral element
relationship: part_of UBERON:4440008 ! fin radial skeleton

