[Term]
id: UBERON:3010318
name: obsolete iridophore
namespace: uberon/phenoscape-anatomy
def: "A pigment cell derived from the neural crest. The cell contains flat light-reflecting platelets, probably of guanine, in stacks called reflecting platets or iridisomes. The color-generating components produce a silver, gold, or iridescent color." [AAO:BJB]
synonym: "guanophore" RELATED [UBERON:3010318]
