comment: This term refers to a specific structure in male salamanders (also called the vent gland). A similarly named structure exists in female salamander but does not denote the same structure. There is a general "vent gland" asserted through the AAO, but due to the uncertain homologies across all amphibians we have not synonymized the term "dorsal gland" with the existing term "vent gland".
