[Typedef]
id: phalanx_number
name: phalanx number
namespace: uberon
def: "x phalanx_number N if and only if (i) x is a phalanx, and (ii) x is phalanx number N in a series of phalanges repeated along an prixomo-distal axis, with phalanx_number 1 being the proximalmost phalanx. Note that in humans, the distalmost phalanx has phlanax_number 3, except in ray_number 1, where the distalmost has phalanx_number 2" [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phalanx_bone#Phalangeal_formula, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165]
def: "x phalanx_number N if and only if (i) x is a phalanx, and (ii) x is phalanx number N in a series of phalanges repeated along an prixomo-distal axis, with phalanx_number 1 being the proximalmost phalanx. Note that in humans, the distalmost phalanx has phlanax_number 3, except in ray_number 1, where the distalmost has phalanx_number 2" [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165, Wikipedia:Phalanx_bone#Phalangeal_formula]
comment: Most land mammals including humans have a 2-3-3-3-3 formula in both the hands (or paws) and feet. Primitive reptiles typically had the formula 2-3-4-4-5, and this pattern, with some modification, remained in many later reptiles and in the mammal-like reptiles. The phalangeal formula in the flippers of cetaceans (marine mammals) is 2-12-8-1
xref: UBPROP:0000105
property_value: is_count_of UBERON:0003221
property_value: preceding_element_is BSPO:0000100
is_metadata_tag: true

[Typedef]
id: pharyngeal_arch_number
name: pharyngeal arch number
namespace: uberon
def: "x pharyngeal_arch_number N if and only if (i) x is a pharyngeal arch, and (ii) x is ancestrally pharyngeal arch number N in a series of pharyngeal arches repeated along a antero-posterior axis, with arch_number 1 being the mandibular arch." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165]
comment: Note that gill arch N = PA N-2. the term branchial_arch is ambiguous.
xref: UBPROP:0000103
property_value: is_count_of UBERON:0002539
property_value: preceding_element_is BSPO:0000096
property_value: terminology_notes "gill arch N = PA N-2. the term branchial_arch is ambiguous." xsd:string
is_metadata_tag: true

